---
layout: base.njk
title: Teams
description: "Choose an age group to see training times, coaches and what a first session looks like."
---
<section class="policy-hero"><div class="policy-wrap"><h1>Find your team</h1><p>Every Lion starts somewhere. Choose an age group to see training times, coaches and what a first session looks like.</p></div></section>
<section id="teams">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="team-grid">
{% for team in teams.list %}
<div class="team-card"><div class="team-card-top"></div><div class="team-card-body">
<div class="team-tag">{{ team.tag }}</div><h3>{{ team.name }}</h3>
<p>{{ team.description }}</p>
<a class="team-link" href="{{ team.linkUrl }}">{{ team.linkLabel }}</a>
</div></div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
</section>
